{"id":198308,"name":"Sheraton 22F, 2BDR","headline":"The 2 BDR Emerald Condo | 5 min to CAI Airport ","summary":"This trendy and colorful apartment sleeps 4 guests comfortably. The apartment has 1 closed bedroom, 1 glass bedroom, a small full bathroom and a kitchenette. It is fully equipped with all the amenities needed to make your stay unique and memorable and is managed by Xuru Stays. ","description":{"Space":"\n\r\nThe apartment features 2 bedrooms, one of which is a glass bedroom and 1 full bathroom, with a spacious colorful living room that is furnished with a couch, a dining  table and a fully equipped kitchenette featuring a Nespresso coffee machine, kettle, cooking utensils, microwave and a hot plate for cooking. There is cable and smart TV to stream your favorite content along with fast and reliable Wifi.\r\nThere bedrooms feature queen size beds.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions. Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\nThe neighborhood is packed with cafés and restaurants. \r\nThis neighborhood is full of life with plenty of street food options (the apartment is quite and peaceful though) \r\n\r\n- Banks and other services are also within walking distance. \r\n\r\n- There is a sports complex for most sports activities (running track, football, basketball, squash, tennis..) which is a 10 min walk from the apartment. \r\n \r\n- Giza Pyramids is a 50 min drive\r\n- Downtown Cairo is a 30 min drive \r\n- New Cairo is a 15 min drive\r\n- Cairo International Airport is a 5 min drive.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nAll places are reachable by car and Uber but if you want take a walk it's not going to take you more than 5 minutes to reach any of the services around.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that additional unreported guests are not allowed to access or enter the property."},"city":"Cairo","capacity_of_guests":4,"number_of_bedrooms":2,"number_of_beds":4,"number_of_bathrooms":1,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"81 Ashbelya, Sheraton Al Matar, El Nozha, Cairo Governorate 11780","location_address2":"","location_lat":"30.1056622","location_lng":"31.3713387","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":25,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":397749,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 150 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. (In case of disapproval from community security office, guests will be fully refunded).\r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the 