 you for contacting us with Hany the driver who pick us up and dropping us off to the airport providing good service almost at midnight.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:10.000000Z"},{"id":5192683,"review":"من أجمل الأماكن اللي سكنت فيها ، انصح به بشدّه وشكرًا ع حسن الاستضافة 🙏🏻","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z"},{"id":5219085,"review":"住了很多次了，很满意。","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5227463,"review":"Check-in is very difficult, especially if they do not know that there is a reservation and the check-in is late and waiting for half an hour at the gate to wait for a worker to come to help, the place is beautiful, tidy, quiet and worth the price, the check-out should be more than the specified time at least\n\n- It is necessary to reduce the annoying care in the subject of guests who come, knowing that simple and smooth measures should be taken to introduce guests and not to be so disturbing.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5228130,"review":"We went from London to visit Cairo for a week. We had a fantastic stay with Xuru Stays! From the moment we arrived, we felt right at home. The apartment was not only clean and comfortable but also beautifully decorated and well-equipped with everything we needed for a relaxing stay.\n\nThe location was ideal, easy for Uber to reach within 3-4 mins, making it easy for us to explore the city and enjoy all that it had to offer. The apartment was 10 mins away from the airport, makes it so easy especially on the way back, we still enjoyed a few hours before in the city before our flight. \n\nCommunication with Xuru,s team on Airbnb chat was seamless, and they were always quick to respond to any questions or concerns we had. They also provided us with great recommendations for local attractions.\n\nWe highly recommend their place to anyone looking for a wonderful Airbnb experience.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:16.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:16.000000Z"},{"id":5235165,"review":"very good location. The bed and the sheets were super clean. Xuru Team was super professional (espically Fatma & Mariam) with my requests and very responsive.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5237724,"review":"el apartamento estaba aceptable. no obstante la zona era bastante mala al igual que el déficit así como los ascensores parecían de un barrio y edificios marginales. no lo recomiendo para nada!!! deberían poner fotos del edificio así como de la entrada y de la zona.... no me pareció que sean honestos con esto .","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5249112,"review":"سكن جميل جدا","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5253037,"review":"اخذت شقه أخرى قبلها وكانت ممتازه جدا ولكن لعدم وجود غساله فيها تم تغييرها لهذه الشقه هيا جيده ولكن اقل من مستوى الشقه  الاولى  …","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5259042,"review":"The apartment was exactly what I was looking for: it was clean, spacious and comfortable. The hosts from Xuru were very responsive whenever I had a question - usually responding immediately.\n\nI'm very familiar with Cairo and wanted to stay in this area as it was convenient to some business dealings I had for a couple days. It's on a local street, and not in a fancy neighborhood, but it was safe and an affordable price, which is what I wanted with my stay.\n\nThank you!","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5277796,"review":"The place is a great","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5283599,"review":"شكرا لكم ومعليش على اني غلطنا في شي ❤️❤️🥰","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5303168,"review":"سكن رائع جداً وهادئ ومهتمين للتفاصيل في منطقة جميلة ومليئة بالخدمات ، اشكر المستضيف شكر خاص على تجاوبهم معنا في كل وقت وعلى كل طلب كانو دائماً موافقين ❤️","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5327248,"review":"Spacious apartment as described, ideal for short and long stays.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5328414,"review":"Comme sur les photos \nÀ côté de l’aéroport\nMerci!","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5333184,"review":"Very responsive and helpful host , great interior designing and felt like home","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5345700,"review":"This apartment was the perfect home base for my recent trip to cairo. The location was incredibly convenient - just a short walk to  restaurants, and transit. The apartment itself was spotless and comfortable, with all the amenities I needed for a great stay. The host was also extremely helpful and responsive throughout the booking process and during my visit. I would highly recommend this listing to anyone visiting the area. It provided an excellent value and truly made me feel at home. I hope to stay here again on my next trip!","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5356977,"review":"realy stuff is so co opertive friendly and so polite..place is perfect..reachable .realy thanks for tge host","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5362813,"review":"Place was good, near to most of services, near to airport, hosts from Xuru were very responsive. \n\nThey should put pictures of the building as well as the entrance and the area, internet was very slow. \n\nOverall, it was good stay for 2 nights.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5381064,"review":"Amazing place and very comfortable","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5383885,"review":"شكرا والاهتمام لنظافة دورة المياه و ارض الشقة لابد من غسيلها ممتاز","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5395565,"review":"Good, clean and quiet place with a perfect area full of restaurants and shops. The host and his team are very friendly and we always get a quick response for our questions.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5426527,"review":"it was a nice stay 🙏 thank you guys","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5429378,"review":"جميل جدا","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5429518,"review":"多次入住，很方便，客户沟通也比较顺利。","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5434224,"review":"الاستديو خرااااافي وانت مسافر تحتاج نوع من التغيير حتى المكان المتواجد فيه، فهنا حصلت ضالتي الوان ومكان دافي حنون متكاااامل شعرت حرفياً اني في بيتي واهتميت فيه لدرجه قبل لا امشي رتبت المكان وبخرته وغسلت الاواني ورميت النفايات  كل مره اجي مصر راح اعتمده فقط عتبي ع مدخل العماره والمصعد لكن لأباس به في الاستديو من اول ماتتدخله راح ينسيك كل شيء شكررررراً لكم 💚🧡🤍","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5460227,"review":"المكان كان مريح جداً ومرتب .. \nسرعة بالاستجابة في حال اي صيانة او استفسار. \nمستوى امان عالي وكاميرات عند مدخل المنزل 👍.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5474223,"review":"Thank you! Communication was always quick and the host payed for cleaning during our stay which was nice. \nThe apartment is right next to another apartment, which made a lot of noise. The key system is a bit strange. \nAnd we couldn't get the code to the keybox ahead of time and internet connection made it difficult to get it once we arrived in Cairo. The apartment was clean but not deep cleaned. \nOverall a good experience but definitely a place for improvement.","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5492553,"review":"الشقه مطابقه تمام للصور جميله جداً لرحلة اصدقاء مزوده بكل وسائل الراحه ، الملاك جداً متعاونين ولطيفين ، تبعد عن مول كايروفستافل 15د وعن الزمالك 30دقيقه فقط","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5495938,"review":"Pas de flexibilité sur le départ. Nous avions un avion et l’hôte nous a laissé à la rue alors que nous avions des bagages car il ne voulait pas que l’on reste 1h de plus pour notre avion. Cela n’est pas du tout correct de la part de l’hôte malgré les différentes relances il n’a rien voulu savoir","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5590019,"review":"Great place and very convenient","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5590283,"review":"I enjoyed my time there thank you","rental_id":198308,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5634779,"r